    "severity": "medium",
    "comment": "`arguments[i].getClass()` throws a NullPointerException if the argument resolver returns an array containing a null element, and it will also never match a primitive parameter type (e.g. an `int` parameter against an `Integer` argument), so such constructors are silently filtered out and the Preconditions check below fails instead. Consider guarding against null arguments and comparing against the boxed parameter type."
