    "file": "junit-jupiter-engine/src/main/java/org/junit/jupiter/engine/config/InstantiatingConfigurationParameterConverter.java",
    "line": 93,
    "category": "style",
    "severity": "low",
    "comment": "The failure message says \"Failed to find unambiguous constructor\", but this condition also fires when zero constructors match, where \"unambiguous\" is misleading. Consider distinguishing the no-candidate case from the ambiguous case in the message."
  }
]

